    "sentence_translations": [
      "My Friend Named Guoqing",
      "",
      "I made a new friend, and his name is Guoqing. I think his name is very hard to pronounce. I often say his name wrong.",
      "One day, I asked him, “Why is your name Guoqing?”",
      "He said, “Because my birthday is October 1st. October 1st is also China’s birthday. It is China’s National Day.",
      "That’s why my dad and mom called me ‘Guoqing’.”",
      "",
      "He also told me that in China, there are many people whose name is also Guoqing. Do you have friends called “Guoqing”?"
    ]
  }
